    {
      "id": "claim_9995eed197db41f88502095266051a11",
      "statement": "candidateKey is derived from provider, approval kind, normalized question text, option numbers, and send text, explicitly excluding label whitespace and box-drawing characters (which would make every TUI redraw look like a new candidate); sourceEpoch only advances at a live prompt boundary, never during replay or terminal reflow, since advancing then would make a merely-restored prompt look like a brand-new one.",
